  "title": "Life, Food and Sleep: viv, vor and somn",
  "short": "viv and vit mean life, vor means eat and somn means sleep.",
  "trouble": "soporific comes from a related word, sopor (deep sleep). voracious is used for appetites of every kind, not only for food.",
  "prereqs": [
    "roots.re-de"
  ],
  "xp": 1,
